== Description ==
This guide is meant to cover the various ways players can debuff. Including but not limited to Spells, Clickies, Procs and Poisons.

AoE = Area of Effect, Targeted.

PB AE = Point Blank Area Effect, around self.

See something missing? Add it! 

See something wrong? Fix it!

=== Details ===
Debuffing is an important aspect of everquest. It will make your adventure easier and safer.

Some examples

Debuffing a mob's magic resistance will make them less resistant to magic based spells, such as enchanter's charm or magic based damage spells.<br>
Debuffing a mob's AC will increase on average the melee damage it takes.<br>
Debuffing a mob's STR will decrease on average the melee damage it does.<br>
Debuffing a mob's Attack Speed will essentially reduce it's melee damage by that #% by making it swing slower.<br>

